        <activityName xml:lang="en">Infrastructure, borehole heat exchanger, 10kW, for heat pump calculation</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Infrastructure, borehole heat exchanger, 10kW, for heat pump calculation
Heat at heat pump without heat distribution.;
UUID: 06e4c59b-5f21-3499-b713-601cb884e658
Includes infrastucture and electricity (Swiss electricity mix) for heat pump. Includes emissions of refrigerant (R134a) during operation. Heat at heat pump, i.e. heat distribution in the house is not included.
Location: Operation in Switzerland (i.e. Swiss electricity mix)
Technology: Based on average SPF2 (Seasonal Performance Factor, including auxiliary energy) of brine-water heat pumps installed in year 1998 operating in Switzerland.
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: statistics 
Extrapolations: see Geography/Text
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_06e4c59b-5f21-3499-b713-601cb884e658.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
